  data: {
    LLM: "Keep Jokers until you can use them for the 'Final Out'. Don't meld your Jokers too early as your opponents might steal them using the exchange rule.\n\nThe 30-point Hurdle: Try to save your initial Aces and Kings to make your first meld. Once you are 'open' (have melded once), the game becomes much easier as you can add to others' piles.\n\nJoker Trapping: Deliberately meld a Joker to lure an opponent into playing a high-value card for the exchange, then using their discarded cards to finish your own hand.",
